UNITY 6 SOULSLIKE COMBAT SYSTEM — MASTER IMPLEMENTATION PROMPT

You are working on a Unity 6 third-person fantasy Soulslike/action RPG.

The goal is to build a professional, scalable and maintainable combat framework suitable as the foundation for a commercial Soulslike game.

The combat should feel deliberate, responsive, weighty and readable, inspired by the general design principles of games such as Dark Souls and Elden Ring, but it must remain an ORIGINAL implementation and must not copy proprietary game code, assets, animations, names or exact mechanics.

